+# Cortex-A53 is ARMv8.0: it has no LSE atomics (ID_AA64ISAR0_EL1[23:20] = 0),
+# so ldadd/ldclr/ldset/swp are UNDEFINED there. -march=armv8-a alone is NOT
+# enough: with Apple clang and -mkernel, __c11_atomic_* still lower to LSE and
+# the 0087 kernel shipped 825 such instructions (QEMU on cortex-a53 raises
+# "Undefined Instruction" at _lck_grp_reference+0x8, the first one executed).
+# -mcpu=cortex-a53 makes the backend emit the LL/SC pair (ldaxr/stxr) instead.
+MACHINE_FLAGS_ARM64_UGGLITE = -DARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_UGGLITE -DBOARD_UGGLITE -DUGG_FAMILY -mcpu=cortex-a53
 
 
